          - label Turnaround Time Reduction
            value 32
            desc With AI-assisted workflows
      - label IMPLEMENTATION GAP
        children
          - label Prospective Validation Rate
            value 5
            desc "<5% of published models reach prospective clinical validation"
          - label FDA-Cleared AI/ML Devices
            value 692
            desc As of 2023
          - label Key Barriers
            desc "Data infrastructure | Regulatory uncertainty | Clinician trust | Workflow integration"
      - label SAFETY & EQUITY
        children
          - label Bias Assessment Rate
            value 18
            desc "Only 18% of studies formally assess demographic bias"
          - label Performance Gap
            desc "5–12 pp sensitivity disparity for underrepresented populations"
          - label Adverse Events
            desc "<1% reported — suspected under-reporting"
      - label RECOMMENDATIONS
        children
          - label Mandate prospective multi-site validation with diverse populations
          - label Standardise demographic-stratified bias auditing as publication requirement
          - label Develop AI-CDSS safety-reporting registries (pharmacovigilance model)
          - label Invest in FHIR/OMOP interoperability standards
          - label Prioritise explainability research for clinician and patient trust
      - label BACKGROUND
        children
          - label 400+ studies reviewed — Lancet Digital Health 2023
          - label ML CDSS across diagnostic, prognostic, therapeutic domains
          - label Promising controlled results vs limited real-world deployment
